{
  "an1.82:0.1": "Numbered Discourses 1.82–97 ",
  "an1.82:0.2": "The Chapter on Negligence ",
  "an1.82:1.0": "82 ",
  "an1.82:1.1": "“Mendicants, I do not see a single thing that is so very harmful as negligence. ",
  "an1.82:1.2": "Negligence is very harmful.” ",
  "an1.82:1.3": "",
  "an1.83:1.0": "83 ",
  "an1.83:1.1": "“Mendicants, I do not see a single thing that is so very beneficial as diligence. ",
  "an1.83:1.2": "Diligence is very beneficial.” ",
  "an1.83:1.3": "",
  "an1.84:1.0": "84 ",
  "an1.84:1.1": "“Mendicants, I do not see a single thing that is so very harmful as laziness. ",
  "an1.84:1.2": "Laziness is very harmful.” ",
  "an1.84:1.3": "",
  "an1.85:1.0": "85 ",
  "an1.85:1.1": "“Mendicants, I do not see a single thing that is so very beneficial as arousing energy. ",
  "an1.85:1.2": "Arousing energy is very beneficial.” ",
  "an1.85:1.3": "",
  "an1.86:1.0": "86 ",
  "an1.86:1.1": "“Mendicants, I do not see a single thing that is so very harmful as having many wishes. ",
  "an1.86:1.2": "Having many wishes is very harmful.” ",
  "an1.86:1.3": "",
  "an1.87:1.0": "87 ",
  "an1.87:1.1": "“Mendicants, I do not see a single thing that is so very beneficial as having few wishes. ",
  "an1.87:1.2": "Having few wishes is very beneficial.” ",
  "an1.87:1.3": "",
  "an1.88:1.0": "88 ",
  "an1.88:1.1": "“Mendicants, I do not see a single thing that is so very harmful as lack of contentment. ",
  "an1.88:1.2": "Lack of contentment is very harmful.” ",
  "an1.88:1.3": 